<!--
  Status-bar icon for VelChat notifications.

  Android renders a small icon as a MASK: every non-transparent pixel becomes the system's
  notification tint, so this is deliberately a flat white silhouette with no gradient and no
  brand colour. The brand violet arrives separately via `setColor()` on the builder, which the
  system uses for the accent — a coloured small icon renders as a solid blob instead.

  A speech bubble rather than the launcher glyph: the launcher icon has a filled background and
  fine detail that turn to mud at 24dp under a mask.
-->
